dealer with a foreign bank said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers expect the dollar could fall below IDR9,500 Thursday, but that will depend on the dollar's movement against its major rivals later Wednesday. The greenback could be anywhere between IDR9,470 and IDR9,525 Thursday, they said.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana; Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Hilary Mc Cully [ 30-03-05 1010GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050330e13u000hr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
