\par\par \b \uc2 Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  To Continue  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2  To Help Rupiah  \b0\par\par\uc2 278 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 2004\par 04:54\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Tuesday it will continue to sell dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to help the beleaguered rupiah.  \par \par \uc2 "We will continue to take necessary actions," Aslim Tadjuddin, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor told Dow Jones Newswires. "If it's necessary, we will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market."  \par \par \uc2 He said the rupiah's recent fall is mainly due to expectations of a U.S. rate hike, which has spurred investors to move their funds to dollar assets.  \par \par \uc2 At 0252 GMT, the rupiah traded at IDR9,230 to the dollar, its lowest level since Nov. 4, 2002. This means the rupiah has lost 8.8% against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the beginning of the year.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said Bank Indonesia was suspected to have sold dollars early Tuesday to curb the U.S. unit's rise.  \par \par \uc2 The rupiah's weakness may fuel inflationary pressures in Indonesia as the country imports some food products. This could pressure the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise interest rates, some analysts said.  \par \par \uc2 But Aslim said he expects inflation to remain under control this year as he believes the large U.S. trade deficit would weaken the dollar in the near future. "The dollar's current strength won't last long," he said.  \par \par \uc2 He also said Bank Indonesia has no plans to raise interest rates. The benchmark weighted average rate of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes was unchanged at 7.32% in a biweekly auction last week.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Dawn Lye [ 25-05-04 0254GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040525e05p0002d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
