\par\par \b \uc2 Bank Indonesia Says To Keep Rates Around Current Levels  \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 2004\par 02:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank Indonesia said Friday that it will maintain interest rates around current levels to achieve an inflation target of between 5% and 6% this year.  \par \par \uc2 The weighted average of Bank Indonesia's 1-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI) notes fell to 7.32% in an auction Wednesday from 7.33% two weeks earlier, and the 3-month SBI rate dropped to 7.24% from 7.25%.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that although on-year inflation in April picked up to 5.92% from 5.11% in March, price increase this year are expected to remain within its target range.  \par \par \uc2 "In the next months, Bank Indonesia will maintain its cautious monetary policies in order to achieve its medium and long-term inflation target," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a press release after a monthly board of governors' meeting late Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 It added that it will "closely watch" the possibility of an increase in the U.S. federal funds rate, which could put pressure on the rupiah.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, to maintain rupiah stability, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and intensify monitoring of banks actively involved in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 The rupiah has recently been under pressure due to the dollar's rise against the yen, and rising concerns over securities ahead of July presidential elections.  \par \par \uc2 It has traded at IDR8,720 to the dollar early Friday, or around 3.4% lower than its level at the end of last year at IDR8,420.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires;62-21 39831277 I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Brett Miller [ 07-05-04 0121GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040507e0570000m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
