\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesia Rupiah Ends Steady On Alleged Bk Indonesia Move  \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 April 2004\par 11:45\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah ended steady Friday as alleged \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  managed to curb the dollar's rise sparked by a sharp drop in the local stock market, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed at IDR8,700, unchanged from its close Thursday, after trading between IDR8,680 and IDR8,710 intraday.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said offshore investors bought dollars as they unloaded Indonesian stocks as part of a trend to exit regional capital markets on worries about the future of the Chinese economy.  \par \par \uc2 The local stock market dropped 2.3% to 783.413 points.  \par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia is suspected to have sold dollars when the greenback was trading around IDR8,700.  \par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia's Deputy Governor Aslim Tadjuddin said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is always ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah if necessary. He, however, didn't specifically confirm that it sold dollars Friday.  \par \par \uc2 Aslim said the rupiah's recent slide is due to external factors, mainly the dollar's rise against the yen, and not due to domestic factors.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said market participants also bought the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to the long weekend. The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed Monday because of a Muslim holiday. Market participants usually prefer to hold dollars during a long market closure.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the dollar-rupiah will track the dollar-yen movement when it resumes trading next week. They expect the dollar to trade between IDR8,675 and IDR8,725 Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 3983-1277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Shishir Mudgil [ 30-04-04 0945GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040430e04u000j5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
