\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Ends Flat,Helped By Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 April 2004\par 11:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah ended flat Thursday as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weather the impact of the dollar's rise against the yen.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed unchanged at IDR8,650. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  touched an intraday high of IDR8,660 earlier in the day tracking the dollar's ascent to above Y109.  \par \par \uc2 But Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped the rupiah recoup its losses.  \par \par \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually sells the dollar in the spot market to help the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It has said that it expects the dollar to trade between IDR8,200 and IDR8,700 in the second quarter of the year. Dealers said the market takes this level as a virtual trading band tolerated by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 However, demand for the dollar remained robust as many local companies usually need the dollar by month-end to pay off maturing offshore debts.  \par \par \uc2 "Demand from local companies provided a strong support to the dollar near IDR8,650 today," a dealer said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the dollar's strength and demand from local companies is expected to maintain an upward bias toward the greenback in the near term, although they expect Bank Indonesia to remain in the market.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers expect the dollar to trade between IDR8,630 and IDR8,670 Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The market is also warily watching political developments as some analysts said the retired Gen. Wiranto has a good chance of being elected president in the July poll.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia could face international isolation if Wiranto wins as he was implicated in the killing of over 1,500 East Timorese when the former Portuguese colony chose to break away from Indonesia in 1999.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Shishir Mudgil [ 22-04-04 0926GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040422e04m000gy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
