\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesia Rupiah Ends Down; Mkt Jittery After Sunday Bomb  \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 10:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah ended lower Tuesday as trading resumed after a long weekend. Players were nervous after a bomb exploded Sunday in the southern outskirts of capital Jakarta, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed at 8,590 rupiah, up from its close Friday at IDR8,560. The local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was closed Monday for a public holiday.  \par \par \uc2 No one was injured in the explosion, which came days after Washington warned Islamic militants may be planning fresh attacks in the world's most populous Muslim nation.  \par \par \uc2 Police said the explosion was an accident that occurred when eight men and a woman were learning to make bomb.  \par \par \uc2 Still, dealers said the incident could signal an increased likelihood of terrorist attacks in the run-up to parliamentary elections early next month.  \par \par \uc2 Dollar demand from local companies to pay maturing offshore debts also pushed the U.S. unit higher. Dealers said Bank Mandiri and Bank Internasional Indonesia were among the most active dollar buyers, likely for the purpose of rolling over their dollar-denominated bonds maturing later this month.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers expect the dollar to test higher ranges Wednesday as local companies are expected to continue buying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to cap the dollar's rise at IDR8,600, they said.  \par \par \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, selling dollars to prevent the local unit from falling sharply.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Bernice Tang [ 23-03-04 0936GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040323e03n000fa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
