\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesia 1-mth SBI rate falls on c.bank comment.  \b0\par\par\uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 2004\par 10:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     JAKARTA, Jan 28 (Reuters) - Indonesia's key interest rate\par on one-month \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  certificates (SBIs) fell sharply in\par an auction on Wednesday, following a comment a day earlier by\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor that the overnight rate may be cut\par further. The rate fell by 20 basis points to 7.86 percent, well\par below expectations in a Reuters survey of five financial\par institutions on Tuesday, which forecast 7.91 percent.\par     "The 20 basis points decline was considered high. It was\par the market response to Burhanuddin Abdullah's comment on the\par FASBI rate," said a money market dealer at a local bank.\par     The dealer said the market was expecting the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par to cut the overnight rate, known as FASBI, from the current\par eight percent in the near future.\par     Abdullah said on Tuesday Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may cut its rupiah\par overnight \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate by 25 basis points to 7.75 percent,\par although no exact time frame was given.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The one-month SBI rate has fallen 45 basis points so far\par this year after an 462 basis points decline in 2003. Benign\par inflation and the relatively stable rupiah \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2   have\par helped the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to lower domestic interest rates.\par     Some analysts expect the declining trend to slow in coming\par months due to increasing risk during lengthy parliamentary and\par presidential elections this year.\par  \par     Following is the result of Bank Indonesia's auction of\par one-month SBI certificates on Wednesday.\par                                           Latest   Previous\par     One month:\par     Weighted average interest rate (pct)    7.86       8.06\par     Amount absorbed (trillions of rupiah)  55.00      18.55\par  \par  - as a percentage of total bids       77.99      52.62\par                       Jan 28  Jan 14  Jan 7  Dec 29  Dec 17\par     One-month SBI       7.86    8.06   8.24    8.31    8.41\par     To access historical SBI rates, please double click\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040128e01s001px\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
