\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesian Rupiah Ends Lower On Dlr Demand From Importers  \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 2003\par 12:15\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah ended lower Thursday as local importers bought the dollar to finance extra food imports ahead of a national holiday, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed at 8,525 rupiah, up from its close at IDR8,480 Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said the state-owned food logistic company, Bulog, was suspected as the main dollar buyer Thursday, most likely to fund increased food imports ahead of a Muslim holiday later this month.  \par \par \uc2 Dollar demand from importers sparked some banks to cover their dollar-short positions, thereby pushing the dollar higher, a move that was exaggerated by thin volume, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 "Other players jumped into the market, cutting their dollar-short positions at losses after they saw the dollar rise above IDR8,500," said a dealer with a European bank in Jakarta. "This further pushed the dollar even higher."  \par \par \uc2 Dealers expect the dollar to maintain its strength Friday, likely rising to IDR8,550 as market participants are expected to continue covering their dollar-short positions.  \par \par \uc2 Still, they don't rule out the possibility of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gaining toward IDR8,600 if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fails to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market.  \par \par \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , usually sells the dollar in the spot market to defend the local unit.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Simon Harvey  \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020031113dzbd000pe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
