\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  c.bank to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  if rupiah weakens more.   \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Oktober 2003\par 15:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Oct 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market if the rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to weaken.   \par \par \uc2 "Today the rupiah got weaker by 0.83 percent... If this continues, we will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to smooth it out, to prevent a sharp fluctuation," \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Burhanuddin Abdullah told Reuters by telephone.   \par \par \uc2 Abdullah also said that Bank Indonesia did not have a target for the rupiah exchange rate but would help it find a "comfortable" level so export and import activity would be uninterrupted.   \par \par \uc2 He said Bank Indonesia needed to slow down the decline in the key interest rate on its one-month debt papers.   \par \par \uc2 "From the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's board of governors meeting today, we believe that there is no change in our policy stance. We have to be more cautious on the declining trend of the SBI. It seems slowing down the SBI rate decline is a must," he said.   \par \par \uc2 The one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  certificate (SBI) has declined by 440 basis points so far this year.   \par \par \uc2 Benign inflation and a relatively stronger and stable rupiah this year had helped the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to maintain its policy of lowering interest rates.   \par \par \uc2 On the overnight rate, known as FASBI, Abdullah said that the bank would keep its options open, adding that it was just one instrument to control liquidity in the market without increasing the burden of both commercial banks and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Currently the FASBI stands at 8.5 percent for the morning session.   \par \par \uc2 The rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was at 8,435/8,445 to the dollar at 1253 GMT.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031014dzae001qq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
